        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Writers often order their documents chronologically because that is easiest for them. Once you have drafted a paper, read it through to see whether you have organized it simply as a narrative of your thinking. If you have, consider revising. Order your ideas not in the way that is easiest for you, but in the way that best helps your readers understand them.",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                184,
                783,
                280
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
